OL,3,GNEWSAPair hope to get church bells
OL,4,Aringing after 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Valerie Kersey and Jeanette Archer,
OL,7,Fthe sound of church bells ringing out
OL,8,Fnear their homes is a childhood memory
OL,9,Fthat has not been heard for 50 years.
OL,11,FThe bells of Grade I listed St Mary's
OL,12,FChurch in Chaddesden, Derby, which date
OL,13,Ffrom 1499, 1652 and 1742, have not rung
OL,14,Ftogether since the 1970s due to
OL,15,Fstructural problems.
OL,17,FWith only one bell currently able to be
OL,18,Fused, Kersey, a former bell ringer at
OL,19,Fthe church and her friend, Archer, have
OL,20,Flaunched a #150,000 fundraising appeal
OL,21,Fto bring the sound of the bells back.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
